==Spanish==
{{wikipedia|lang=es}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|es|VL.|*ninnus}}, probably imitative of infantile language; also could have originated from {{der|es|la|minimus}}. Compare also {{cog|it|nino}} and {{cog|scn|nicu}}. Compare {{m+|en|nun}} for an English word that is formed similarly from imitative origin of infantile speech, as well as possibly {{m|en|nanny}} and {{m|en|nana}}.

